   "body": "<!-- coderabbit-ai-generated:v1 -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: summarize by coderabbit.ai -->\n<!-- review_stack_entry_start -->\n\n<a href=\"https://app.coderabbit.ai/change-stack/ezzz/HFRnow/pull/377?scope=ghh_OusAJGA4HG8ljoOV0wJvVx8NmnZIjc2DdjmxOu0xZWA&amp;cs_source=review_comment\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-stack-in-coderabbit-ui-dark.svg?v=3\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-stack-in-coderabbit-ui.svg?v=3\"><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-stack-in-coderabbit-ui.svg?v=3\" alt=\"Review in Change Stack →\" height=\"32\"></picture></a>\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_end -->\n<!-- recent_review_start -->\n\nNo actionable comments were generated in the recent review.\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong><picture><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-comment-icons-v1/info.svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"></picture> Recent review info</strong></summary>\n<dl>\n<dd>\n\n<!-- review_info_content -->\n<details>\n<summary><strong><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-comment-icons-v1/cog-dark.svg\"><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-comment-icons-v1/cog.svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"></picture> Run configuration</strong></summary>\n<dl>\n<dd>\n\n- **Source mode**: Auto\n- **Repository**: [ezzz/HFRnow](<https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow>)\n- **Branch**: [fix/344-settings-rows-push](<https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/tree/fix%2F344-settings-rows-push>)\n- **File**: [.coderabbit.yaml](<https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/6c47bbed64917ab8dc281862f730cb5979250379/.coderabbit.yaml>)\n- **Commit**: [6c47bbe](<https://git